# Conformance probe pack naming itself as its inner pack (spec 0.34).
format     conformance-inner-self
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.n  8  uint
inner   conformance-inner-self
